  "title": "Bit Digital, Inc. Announces Commencement of Public Offering of its Ordinary Shares",
  "summary": "WhiteFiber Inc., the wholly-owned HPC subsidiary of Bit Digital, Inc. (Nasdaq: BTBT), announced entry into a definitive credit agreement with the Royal Bank of Canada (“RBC”), the largest bank in Canada, to finance its data centers business. The facility provides up to C$60 million in aggregate financing. Proceeds will be used to support the continued buildout of WhiteFiber’s Tier-3 AI data center portfolio.",
